Eurofins Enviro-Works Inc. is seeking a detail-oriented and analytical PLM Laboratory Analyst to join our team in Edmonton, Canada. In this role, you will be responsible for conducting sample preparation and analysis using the appropriate analytical methods. You will play a critical role in supporting our laboratory's efficiency and compliance with industry standards.
